Feature: Generated native cognition mathematics
  Laplace calculates the operator required by a cognition program from typed exact
  substrate state. No flattened graph or permanent embedding becomes semantic authority.

  Scenario: Physicality generates exact structural relations without testimony
    Given a bit-perfect physicality trajectory contains a trunk, nested containers, runs, and codepoint leaves
    When Laplace calculates its structural relation surface
    Then container, constituent, role, ordinal, multiplicity, contains, precedes, follows, tier, and ancestry are reproduced exactly
    And every relation closes to the physicality recipe, trajectory bytes, and calculation receipt
    And absence of semantic testimony cannot erase or weaken those calculated structural facts
    And changing one ordinal or child identity fails exact trajectory reconstruction

  Scenario: Relation types retain different compatibility laws
    Given one physicality calculates precedes and contains relations
    And eligible testimony relates the same entities through synonym and translation
    When a cognition program generates typed incidence applications for those relations
    Then each application uses its declared source field, target field, transport law, direction, and units
    And replacing all four laws with scalar pairwise similarity fails the operator contract

  Scenario: Ordered n-ary composition remains n-ary
    Given an exact physicality trajectory has a container and five constituent roles
    When its compatibility operator is generated
    Then the operator retains the container identity, five role identities, ordinals, physicality recipe, and calculation receipt
    And replacing the composition with anonymous pairwise edges fails exact reconstruction

  Scenario: Relation planes cannot be concatenated into scalar affinity
    Given two substrate states have identical endpoint pairs and scalar magnitudes
    But one state calculates containment and precedence while the other attests synonymy and translation
    When each state generates its program-scoped operator
    Then their typed domains, transports, direction, defects, and induced behavior differ
    And concatenating the rows, summing duplicate pairs, and symmetrizing them produces an identical scalar graph
    And that scalar-graph implementation fails relation-law nonflattening

  Scenario: Evidence metrizes relation defects without manufacturing independence
    Given one root observation, ten copied sources, and one independently corroborating observation
    When the evidence metric is calculated for the relation defect space
    Then the ten copies share one dependence root
    And the independent observation contributes a second eligible root
    And treating all eleven source rows as independent changes the metric and fails non-amplification

  Scenario: Contradiction does not make a spectral precision metric indefinite
    Given independently supported testimony asserts competing typed relation constraints
    When a self-adjoint energy operator is generated
    Then each competing constraint retains its provenance, target, uncertainty, and positive semidefinite precision
    And contradiction is visible in the typed defect calculus
    But replacing contradiction with a negative precision weight fails the spectral operator contract
    And a directional or signed execution uses only its separately declared solver contract

  Scenario: Operator generation is state and program specific
    Given canonical state contains more relation families than a cognition program requires
    When the native planner generates the program's operator application
    Then only eligible typed values under the pinned context, time, world, and evidence epoch are calculated
    And the receipt identifies every selected relation law and source boundary
    And no universal adjacency graph or permanent semantic embedding is deposited

  Scenario: Matrix-free and published acceleration agree
    Given the same pinned operator program and source boundary
    When the native engine applies it directly and through a validated materialized operator perfcache
    Then every declared result agrees within the operator's numeric contract
    And corrupting one perfcache block fails parity before publication

  Scenario: Solver residual is not a frayed-edge signal
    Given a regularized operator system with an independently calculated exact solution
    When Laplace solves the system
    Then the solver residual is zero within the declared numerical bound
    And b minus the unregularized operator application equals the regularization term
    And neither value creates a frayed-edge hypothesis

  Scenario: Existing relation incompatibility is typed
    Given a semantic field violates one attested translation law but satisfies one physicality-calculated precedence law
    When typed compatibility defects are calculated
    Then only the translation defect has high evidence-metrized energy
    And the translation defect retains its witnesses, context, epoch, and field components
    And the precedence result retains its physicality recipe and calculation receipt

  Scenario: A missing relation earns a hypothesis only on withheld evidence
    Given motif examples are split into generation, fitting, evaluation, and counterexample boundaries
    When a candidate missing relation is generated and the affected semantic state is recalculated
    Then candidate value is its improvement on the unchanged evaluation boundary minus declared complexity
    And training-energy improvement alone cannot establish candidate value
    And leaking evaluation testimony into candidate generation fails the experiment
    And a positive value creates a derived hypothesis rather than a witnessed relation

  Scenario: Innovation retains the prediction it violated
    Given a pinned prior substrate boundary predicts a typed observation
    When new testimony differs materially from that prediction
    Then Laplace records the observed value, predicted value, typed innovation, uncertainty, context, epoch, and calculation receipt
    And the innovation can trigger investigation without becoming an independent claim about its own cause

  Scenario: A request compiles before execution
    Given a multilingual utterance and active cross-modal discourse state
    When Laplace prepares cognition
    Then it produces a typed logical program containing goal, context, references, constraints, evidence contract, and result contract
    And the planner lowers it to a costed vector-first physical ISA plan
    And different physical plans with the same logical semantics produce equivalent results and receipts

  Scenario: Guidance state retains typed deficits and obligations
    Given a goal requires an actor, event, time, place, cause, mechanism, and supporting evidence
    And the current state resolves only the event, time, and place
    When Laplace calculates its cognition guidance state
    Then actor, cause, mechanism, and evidence remain distinct unresolved completion obligations
    And each obligation retains its bindings, world, time, context, evidence, authority, and result contract
    And replacing the guidance state with one elected topic fails canonical state reconstruction

  Scenario: Curiosity schedules an actionable knowledge deficit
    Given one unresolved referent is required to complete the active goal
    And one unrelated motif vacancy has greater raw novelty
    When the executive compares eligible information-seeking operations
    Then it ranks expected reduction of the relevant typed deficit, information value, cost, evidence rules, and authority
    And it can select structural calculation, indexed search, research, experiment, clarification, or an explicit unresolved disposition
    And raw novelty alone cannot divert the active cognition program

  Scenario: Guidance operations have typed operands and predicted effects
    Given resolve-referent and explain-cause are legal cognition operations
    When either operation enters a physical cognition plan
    Then its typed operands, preconditions, predicted obligation effects, resource cost, effect authority, and receipt contract are explicit
    And an execution provider cannot change those logical semantics
    And a scalar search priority cannot replace the operation or its typed deficit state

  Scenario: Guidance completion is semantic rather than positional
    Given an indexed search reaches a requested entity but leaves one required causal explanation unresolved
    When the guidance loop evaluates completion
    Then the cognition program remains incomplete
    And completion succeeds only after every required obligation is satisfied or receives a permitted typed unresolved disposition
    And a nonempty row set, endpoint arrival, or minimum scalar cost cannot certify semantic completion

  Scenario: Action selection evaluates isolated predicted states
    Given answer, clarify, correct, calculate, research, execute, and unknown are admissible semantic acts
    When firmware evaluates their predicted typed defects, information value, costs, evidence, and authority
    Then each act is evaluated without mutating canonical state
    And hard validity constraints apply before deterministic comparison and tie rules
    And the selected act and rejected candidates have replayable decision receipts
